# ─────────────── Database (Supabase Postgres) ───────────────
# Where to get it:
#   Supabase dashboard → your project → Connect (top bar) → "ORMs" / "Connection string"
#   Use the **Session pooler** string (host: ...pooler.supabase.com, port 5432).
#   Do NOT use the Transaction pooler (port 6543) — Payload runs DDL/migrations
#   and needs session-level features the transaction pooler doesn't support.
#   Replace [YOUR-PASSWORD] with your database password (Settings → Database).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[YOUR-PASSWORD]@aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres"

# ─────────────── Payload ───────────────
# Signs auth tokens. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
PAYLOAD_SECRET="YOUR_SECRET_HERE"

# ─────────────── Public URL ───────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"

# ─────────────── YouTube Data API v3 (optional) ───────────────
# Live sub count + video/view counts + recent/live/featured videos on profiles.
# Where to get it (free): console.cloud.google.com → new project →
#   "APIs & Services" → Library → enable "YouTube Data API v3" →
#   Credentials → Create credentials → API key. Restrict it to the YouTube Data API.
# Leave blank to disable the YouTube sections.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=""

# ─────────────── Search Console verification (optional, SEO) ───────────────
# Proves you own the site so Google/Bing index it and show search performance.
# Google: search.google.com/search-console → Add property (URL prefix = your prod
#   URL) → choose "HTML tag" → copy the content="..." value (just the token) here.
# Bing:   bing.com/webmasters → Add site → "Meta tag" → copy the msvalidate.01 value.
# Emit nothing until set. After deploying with the token, click "Verify".
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=""
NEXT_PUBLIC_BING_SITE_VERIFICATION=""
